1
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:06,000
Letter to Grandmother

2
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:15,370
Hai Phong, November 6, 2003

3
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:19,680
Dear Grandmother!

4
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:29,330
Long time, grandchild hasn't come home, grandchild misses grandmother very much.

5
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:35,240
How is grandmother's health recently?

6
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:41,310
Grandchild's family here is fine.

7
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:46,400
This year, grandchild studies grade 3.

8
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:55,220
From start of school year until now, grandchild is always praised by teachers, grandmother!

9
00:00:55,220 --> 00:01:02,480
Holiday, grandchild often is allowed by parents to go play.

10
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:28,910
Grandchild still remembers last year went home, flew kite on levee with brother Tuan and every night sat listening to grandmother tell fairy tales under moonlight.

11
00:01:30,370 --> 00:01:43,310
Grandchild promises grandmother will study very well, always well-behaved for grandmother happy.

12
00:01:43,310 --> 00:01:52,620
Grandchild wishes grandmother always healthy, live long.

13
00:01:52,620 --> 00:02:01,480
Grandchild looks forward to summer to come home visit grandmother.

14
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:03,970
Grandchild of grandmother

15
00:02:03,970 --> 00:02:06,800
Duc

16
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:14,910
Tran Hoai Duc

